args.sparql:
PREFIX dbo: <http://dbpedia.org/ontology/>
PREFIX dbr: <http://dbpedia.org/resource/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>

SELECT ?film ?filmLabel ?director ?directorDeath WHERE {
  VALUES ?film { dbr:The_Glass_Wall dbr:Where_Does_It_Hurt%3F }
  ?film dbo:director ?director .
  ?director dbo:deathDate ?directorDeath .
  OPTIONAL { ?film rdfs:label ?filmLabel . FILTER(lang(?filmLabel) = 'en') }
}
ORDER BY DESC(?directorDeath)
LIMIT 1

args.answer:
The film whose director died later is "Where Does It Hurt?" — its director Rod Amateau died on 2003-06-29, which is later than Maxwell Shane (director of The Glass Wall), who died on 1983-10-25.

